girl group Le Sserafim, and a former member of South Korean–Japanese girl group Iz*One and Japanese girl groups AKB48 and its sister group HKT48. Miyawaki began her music career with the girl group HKT48 in 2011 and was a concurrent member of their sister group AKB48 from 2014 to 2018. During her tenure, she held center positions for the singles \"Kimi wa Melody\" and \"No Way Man\".","title":"Sakura Miyawaki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sakura_Miyawaki"}},"Q93132814":{"id":"Q93132814","name":"AleXa","ko":"알렉사","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Alexaundra Christine Schneiderman","Alex Christine","Kim Seri"],"birth":"1996-12-09","death":"","birthplace":"Tulsa","nationality":["United States","South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"2019","agencies":[{"name":"ZB Label","korean":true,"id":"Q98636197","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[],"links":{"website":"https://www.alexazb.com","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/seriinade_/","x":"https://x.com/seriinade","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPJAh8PJSgDk1aPsnDsxZ3g","tiktok":"https://www.tiktok.com/@Seriinade","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/4jCGRzuZkwo8CxboiANMEU","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/89d6f478-1eda-42f6-956a-d6d8b7524cc1"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Alexaundra Christine Schneiderman, known professionally as AleXa or Kim Se-ri (김세리), formerly Alex Christine (알렉스 크리스틴), is an American singer based in South Korea. She debuted as a K-pop singer in October 2019. In 2022, she represented her home state Oklahoma in NBC's American Song Contest with the song \"Wonderland\" where she won with 710 points.","title":"AleXa","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AleXa"}}}}